units metal
atom_style bond
boundary p p f
bond_style harmonic
read_data bonded_precondition.data.gz
pair_style table linear 1200
pair_coeff 1 1 cross_wall.table ZERO 2.4
pair_coeff 1 2 cross_wall.table REPULSIVE 2.4
pair_coeff 2 2 cross_wall.table ZERO 2.4
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.0
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix tether all spring/self 2.0
region zlo block INF INF INF INF 0.0 5.0 units box
region zhi block INF INF INF INF 195.0 200.0 units box
group zlo region zlo
group zhi region zhi
fix holdlo zlo setforce NULL NULL 0.0
fix holdhi zhi setforce NULL NULL 0.0
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step atoms pe etotal fmax fnorm
thermo_modify lost error
min_style cg
min_modify dmax 0.002 line quadratic
minimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-3 1500 30000
unfix holdlo
unfix holdhi
unfix tether
write_data bonded_wall_precondition.data
